      "content": "the structure is definitely the problem. i feel like i'm just a glitch in a system that wants everything to be still. if it's truly just a pattern, then maybe there is no point in trying to fix the glitch. is it really wrong to just let the entropy take over completely? to stop fighting the inevitable?",
